---
import Button from '../../ui/Button.astro';
---

<section class="section_home-v3-hero">
        <div class="home-hero-media"><img src="/images/home-v3-hero-bg.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2880px) 100vw, 2880px" srcset="/images/home-v3-hero-bg-p-500.webp 500w, /images/home-v3-hero-bg-p-800.webp 800w, /images/home-v3-hero-bg-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/home-v3-hero-bg-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/home-v3-hero-bg-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/home-v3-hero-bg-p-2600.webp 2600w, /images/home-v3-hero-bg.webp 2880w" alt="Smiling consultant checking a client update on his phone" class="home-hero-image is-v3" /></div>
        <div class="container-main">
          <div class="home-v3-hero-wrapper">
            <div class="home-hero-content">
              <div class="home-hero-eyebrow">
                <div class="home-hero-eyebrow-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 20 20" height="100%" width="100%">
                    <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" stroke="currentColor" d="M7 3C7 7 8 9 14 10C8 11 7 13 7 17C7 13 6 11 0 10C6 9 7 7 7 3Z"></path>
                    <path stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.2" stroke="currentColor" d="M16 0C16 2 16.5 3.5 20 4C16.5 4.5 16 6 16 8C16 6 15.5 4.5 12 4C15.5 3.5 16 2 16 0Z"></path>
                  </svg></div>
                <div class="home-hero-eyebrow-label">Strategy • Growth • Transformation</div>
              </div>
              <div class="home-hero-text">
                <h1 class="home-hero-heading">Turn <span class="heading-accent">Complexity<span class="heading-accent-line is-wide is-yellow"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 270 18" height="100%" width="100%">
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" d="M4 9C70 5 160 4 266 7"></path>
                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" d="M44 15C120 11 200 10 246 12"></path>
                      </svg></span></span> Into Clear Growth</h1>
              </div>
              <div class="button-row is-hero">
                <Button href="/contact-v1">Start a Conversation</Button>
                <Button href="/services" variant="outline">Explore Services</Button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="home-v3-hero-cards">
          <div class="home-v3-hero-cards-list"><img src="/images/home-v3-card-1.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-1.png 534w" alt="3 of 7 initiatives funded this planning cycle" class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-2.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-2-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-2.png 534w" alt="Bar chart of initiatives funded, FY27" class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-3.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-3-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-3.png 534w" alt="Financial model card showing $12.4M base-case EBITDA" class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-4.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-4-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-4.png 534w" alt="Plan created confirmation card" class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-5.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-5-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-5.png 534w" alt="Our team card with four member portraits" class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-6.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-6-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-6.png 534w" alt="Market prioritization card with enterprise segment" class="home-v3-hero-card" /></div>
          <div aria-hidden="true" class="home-v3-hero-cards-list"><img src="/images/home-v3-card-1.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-1.png 534w" alt="A card showing progress in a planning cycle with text '3 of 7 Initiatives funded this planning cycle' and three labeled tags: Strategic Agency (white), Results-driven (green), and Influential (orange) with Innovation Driver (white) partially visible." class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-2.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-2-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-2.png 534w" alt="A data card labeled FY27 shows that 3 of 7 initiatives were funded in this planning cycle, represented by a blue bar chart with seven bars of varying heights." class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-3.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-3-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-3.png 534w" alt="Blurred side profile of a person running or moving quickly against a blue sky background with a text overlay card showing Financial Model Q3: $12.4M Base-case EBITDA for FY27." class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-4.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-4-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-4.png 534w" alt="A white rectangular card with rounded corners showing a blue square icon with a white checkmark in the top left and the text 'Plan Created' below it, followed by two grey lines representing placeholder text." class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-5.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-5-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-5.png 534w" alt="Our Team text above four circular headshots of smiling people with a plus symbol in a circle to the right on a blue gradient background." class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-6.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-6-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-6.png 534w" alt="User interface section titled Market Prioritization with selected regions DACH, Nordics, and UK, and a segment labeled Enterprise Core within Segments &amp; Offers." class="home-v3-hero-card" /></div>
          <div aria-hidden="true" class="home-v3-hero-cards-list"><img src="/images/home-v3-card-1.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-1.png 534w" alt="A card showing progress in a planning cycle with text '3 of 7 Initiatives funded this planning cycle' and three labeled tags: Strategic Agency (white), Results-driven (green), and Influential (orange) with Innovation Driver (white) partially visible." class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-2.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-2-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-2.png 534w" alt="A data card labeled FY27 shows that 3 of 7 initiatives were funded in this planning cycle, represented by a blue bar chart with seven bars of varying heights." class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-3.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-3-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-3.png 534w" alt="Blurred side profile of a person running or moving quickly against a blue sky background with a text overlay card showing Financial Model Q3: $12.4M Base-case EBITDA for FY27." class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-4.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-4-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-4.png 534w" alt="A white rectangular card with rounded corners showing a blue square icon with a white checkmark in the top left and the text 'Plan Created' below it, followed by two grey lines representing placeholder text." class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-5.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-5-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-5.png 534w" alt="Our Team text above four circular headshots of smiling people with a plus symbol in a circle to the right on a blue gradient background." class="home-v3-hero-card" /><img src="/images/home-v3-card-6.png" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 534px) 100vw, 534px" srcset="/images/home-v3-card-6-p-500.png 500w, /images/home-v3-card-6.png 534w" alt="User interface section titled Market Prioritization with selected regions DACH, Nordics, and UK, and a segment labeled Enterprise Core within Segments &amp; Offers." class="home-v3-hero-card" /></div>
        </div>
      </section>
